OL,3,ASkepta: 'I'm what it looks like if you
OL,4,Agive an immigrant child a chance'
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of the biggest names in grime is
OL,7,Fback - and he's picked his moment.
OL,9,F"Finally," Skepta promises BBC
OL,10,FNewsbeat, "some good rap music, some
OL,11,Fgood UK grime sounds."
OL,13,FThe Fork and Knife has been a long time
OL,14,Fin the making. Seven years on from his
OL,15,Flast album, Ignorance Is Bliss, and
OL,16,Fmore than two years since it was first
OL,17,Fteased, the rapper knows how to keep
OL,18,Ffans waiting.
OL,20,FBut, as he's keen to point out, "you
OL,21,Fcan't rush greatness".
